  "handbook-crackinghelp-text": "要将鸡蛋敲入碗或桶中，装备鸡蛋并瞄准容器，然后按住<hk>Shift</hk>+<icon name='rightmousebutton'></icon>进行“部分”敲击，你手中会得到一个<a href=\"handbook://item-aculinaryartillery:eggyolk-chicken\">敲开的蛋</a>，容器中则得到<a href=\"handbook://item-aculinaryartillery:eggwhiteportion\">蛋清</a>。对着敲开的蛋再次按住<hk>Shift</hk>+<icon name='rightmousebutton'></icon>可以进一步敲击，最终你手中留下<a href=\"handbook://item-aculinaryartillery:eggshell\">蛋壳</a>，容器中获得<a href=\"handbook://item-aculinaryartillery:eggyolkportion-chicken\">蛋黄</a>。或者，按住<hk>Shift</hk>+<hk>Ctrl</hk>+<icon name='rightmousebutton'></icon>进行“完全”敲击，你手中会留下<a href=\"handbook://item-aculinaryartillery:eggshell\">蛋壳</a>，容器中获得<a href=\"handbook://item-aculinaryartillery:eggyolkfullportion-chicken\">蛋液</a>。",

